# Local-only Worker secrets for `pnpm dev`. Copy this file to .dev.vars.
# .dev.vars is never committed, and it holds test values only. Real secrets
# for staging and production are stored as Cloudflare Worker secrets.
#
# Windy Webcams API key (free tier is fine locally): create one at
# https://api.windy.com/keys. Leave it empty to skip the Windy import jobs;
# the synthetic seed (`pnpm db:seed`) works without it.
WINDY_API_KEY=
